 sfinney@violet.ccit.arizona.edu writes...
>  I have NH 3.1 on a vax 4000-500 running VMS 5.4-2, an I am just a plain ole
> user (read no special privileges), is there a way to make my nethack 3.1 a
> multi-user game?  How do you create a multi-user playdround?  What privs do
> you need?

     If you mean allowing assorted users to each play their own game
using your playground directory, [.sys.vms]install.com sets things up
that way by default.  You shouldn't have to do anything unless you
tried to set things up manually.  No privileges are necessary, but
you have to leave the playground directory and its [.save] subdirectory
writable by other users.

     If you mean allowing multiple users to play against and/or with
each other in the same game, you've got the wrong program...

